  {
   "type": "grammar",
   "title": "Questions need no extra words",
   "md": "To ask a yes/no question, keep the word order and raise your voice at the end – exactly like English *You're well?* [[شما خوبید.|shomā khub-id.|You are well.]] becomes [[شما خوبید؟|shomā khub-id?|Are you well?]] Notice the Persian question mark [[؟|?]] faces the other way.\n\nQuestion words such as [[چطور|chetor|how]] go where the answer would go: [[حال شما چطور است؟|hāl-e shomā chetor ast?]] – *your state how is?*",
